"Questors' rules are known to all true powers."
"Questors are the chief true powers; their fights are called Questor-tier combat."
"Levels carry little weight for Questors; they plateau while their levels still climb."
"Years later the Heirs passed level 729 and called it the territory of true power."
"After clearing a blight, all five Heirs were past level 1000."
